  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 102.22 “Excavation Tax appeal” means an RSA 72-B:13 appeal of an excavation tax assessed under RSA 72-B:4.\n\nSource. #7152, eff 12-10-99; ss by #7875, eff 4-18-03); ss by 8985, eff 9-24-07 (from Tax 102.22); ss by #10623, eff 6-26-14 (from Tax 102.24); ss by 13686, eff 7-19-23",
